{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10112010","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10112010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1011201001:0":{"text":"コリンさん、先ほどからずっと肩と肘をかばっているようですが、大丈夫ですか？","source_cn":"科林先生，看你一路都在捂着肩膀和手肘，身体还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x920388EC328F0D4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1011201002:0":{"text":"大丈夫だよ、ハムスターのお嬢さん。今は先を急ごう。","source_cn":"没事。仓鼠小姑娘，抓紧赶路吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91B8C1D77A7065DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1011201003:0":{"text":"そうですか……もし具合が悪いのなら、ロンロンみたいに無理しちゃだめですよ。","source_cn":"唔……好吧，科林先生，要是你哪里不舒服，别像满满一样逞强。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CB3A9590BBC2315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:科林":{"text":"コリン","source":"科林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}